  "details": "Description\n\nSince build 1358, the main menu lock is not functioning properly. For example, when you lock the menu, the locked position is not remembered, so when you restart VRChat and open the menu, it appears perpendicular to the ground in the front position. Also, even without restarting, the locked height is not remembered, so when the menu is opened, it appears in a slightly lower position.\n\nThese were not a problem in builds prior to 1358.\n\nIn Open Beta Build 1370, the only issue is that the height is not preserved.\n\n--------------------\n\nReproduction steps\n\n1. Unlocks the main menu. (Key icon in the lower right corner of the menu)\n\n2. Grab the menu and move it to the appropriate position.\n\n3. Re-lock the main menu.\n\n4. Close the main menu.\n\n5. Reopen the main menu.",
